<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- P4 (find_feature_plan.md, M7): mid-part clef changes.
     P1: staff 1 starts treble (bar 1), switches to bass at bar 2's
         <attributes>, back to treble at bar 3 -> two ClefChangeMark
         (label "bass" m2, label "treble" m3). The FIRST clef (bar 1) is
         never a change.
     P2: treble throughout, no <clef> after bar 1 -> no mark at all
         (pins "a part with no change produces nothing").
     Only one part contributes clef changes, so the Region 5 / report
     label is NOT part-prefixed (D5). -->
